  m_text: "To throw a distractor, hold <sprite name=\"throw\">.  Aim with <sprite
    name=\"direction\"> and release <sprite name=\"throw\"> to throw.\r\n\r\nDistract
    the polluted embodiment to make it move away from the exit. \r\n\r\nWatch the
    counter next to the cooldown bar on the left side of the screen, to see how many
    distractors you can throw."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1017360d0ff864e458bec55bc28f1042, type: 2}
